{"command": "captured artifact: preventive review outcome OCOR-DEV-REM-0055-193559ef56e2-pre", "exit_code": 0, "label": "preventive-review-outcome", "output": "{\n  \"request_id\": \"OCOR-DEV-REM-0055-193559ef56e2-pre\",\n  \"head_sha\": \"193559ef56e2d13a0b1f882b5f8bac72fe180fca\",\n  \"base_sha\": \"c8bd8b7764b771ee47c949f9c0bc1a5c274ded2b\",\n  \"reviewer\": {\n    \"process\": \"Antigravity CLI\",\n    \"model\": \"gemini-4-argon-high\",\n    \"vendor\": \"Google\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"BLOCKING_FINDINGS\",\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P1\",\n      \"severity\": \"blocking\",\n      \"file\": \"deploy/bootstrap/services/temporal/qualify.py\",\n      \"line\": 102,\n      \"clause\": \"PRE-REVIEW-INPUT-ROBUSTNESS (2026-10-29) punti 1 e 3; NCP-THROUGHPUT-RULES (2026-11-05) punto 1\",\n      \"description\": \"Coercizione e mancata verifica di tipo sui payload JSON esterni in qualify.py, in contraddizione anche con shape_without_coercion=PASS della tabella di autocontrollo: (a) in _bindings (riga 102), 'ports = _object(network.get(\\\"Ports\\\", {}) or {}, \\\"container inspection Ports\\\")' valuta 'or {}' prima di _object(...), convertendo silenziosamente in {} ogni valore falsy non-oggetto di NetworkSettings.Ports ([], False, 0, \\\"\\\"); di conseguenza validate_private_inspection (righe 122-126) accetta un output docker inspect malformato con Ports pari a [], false, 0 o \\\"\\\" restituendo {'health': 'healthy', 'ports': {}} anziche sollevare QualificationError (solo None per Ports assente in Docker puo essere normalizzato a {}); (b) in _require_running_healthy (riga 94), 'state.get(\\\"Paused\\\") is True' non verifica il tipo booleano di State.Paused e accetta come non-paused valori di tipo errato come \\\"true\\\", 1, [], {} o None (usare ad es. 'state.get(\\\"Paused\\\", False) is not False' preserva l'omissione del campo come in deploy/bootstrap/services/temporal/test_qualify.py:40 rifiutando True e ogni non-bool); (c) in validate_lock (righe 70, 72, 74, 82), 'str(server.get(\\\"image\\\", \\\"\\\"))', 'str(admin.get(\\\"image\\\", \\\"\\\"))', 'str(database.get(\\\"image\\\", \\\"\\\"))' e 'str(server.get(\\\"version\\\", \\\"\\\"))' applicano str() direttamente a dati JSON esterni letti da services.lock.json, violando il divieto esplicito di conversione con str() su dati esterni.\",\n      \"evidence\": \"PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -c 'import importlib.util; s=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(\\\"q\\\",\\\"deploy/bootstrap/services/temporal/qualify.py\\\"); q=importlib.util.module_from_spec(s); s.loader.exec_module(q); img=\\\"temporalio/admin-tools@sha256:\\\"+\\\"a\\\"*64; print([q.validate_private_inspection({\\\"Config\\\":{\\\"Image\\\":img},\\\"State\\\":{\\\"Running\\\":True,\\\"Paused\\\":False,\\\"Health\\\":{\\\"Status\\\":\\\"healthy\\\"}},\\\"NetworkSettings\\\":{\\\"Ports\\\":p}},\\\"admin\\\",img) for p in ([],False,0,\\\"\\\")]); print([q.validate_private_inspection({\\\"Config\\\":{\\\"Image\\\":img},\\\"State\\\":{\\\"Running\\\":True,\\\"Paused\\\":p,\\\"Health\\\":{\\\"Status\\\":\\\"healthy\\\"}},\\\"NetworkSettings\\\":{\\\"Ports\\\":{}}},\\\"admin\\\",img) for p in (\\\"true\\\",1,[])])' -> stampa [{'health': 'healthy', 'ports': {}}, ...] senza sollevare QualificationError; inoltre alle righe 70, 72, 74, 82 compare str(...) diretto su campi di services.lock.json.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P2\",\n      \"severity\": \"blocking\",\n      \"file\": \"deploy/bootstrap/services/temporal/qualify.py\",\n      \"line\": 161,\n      \"clause\": \"PRE-REVIEW-INPUT-ROBUSTNESS (2026-10-29) punti 2 e 3; NCP-THROUGHPUT-RULES (2026-11-05) punto 1\",\n      \"description\": \"Mancata traduzione di UnicodeDecodeError (e di errori di lettura/decodifica del lock in qualify()) nell'errore tipizzato QualificationError: (a) in run (righe 158-162), subprocess.run(..., capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=timeout) intercetta solo (OSError, subprocess.TimeoutExpired); se docker inspect o docker exec ... temporal ... emette byte non UTF-8 su stdout o stderr, subprocess.run solleva UnicodeDecodeError (sottoclasse di ValueError, non di OSError), che esce grezza da run(), inspect_container(), cli() e probe(), interrompe wait_ready() senza retry ne rifiuto tipizzato (riga 217 intercetta solo QualificationError) e sfugge anche a main() (riga 323 intercetta solo (OSError, json.JSONDecodeError, QualificationError)), causando crash con traceback grezzo; (b) in qualify (riga 263), 'validate_lock(json.loads(args.lock.read_text(encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\")))' lascia propagare UnicodeDecodeError non tradotta fuori sia da qualify() sia da main(), e lascia uscire da qualify() OSError e json.JSONDecodeError grezzi anziche QualificationError.\",\n      \"evidence\": \"PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 -c 'import importlib.util,sys; s=importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(\\\"q\\\",\\\"deploy/bootstrap/services/temporal/qualify.py\\\"); q=importlib.util.module_from_spec(s); s.loader.exec_module(q); q.run([sys.executable,\\\"-c\\\",\\\"import sys; sys.stdout.buffer.write(b\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\xff\\\\\\\\xfe\\\\\\\")\\\"])' -> solleva UnicodeDecodeError: 'utf-8' codec can't decode byte 0xff in position 0: invalid start byte (non QualificationError); analogamente main([\\\"--lock\\\", \\\"<file con byte 0xff 0xfe>\\\"]) termina con UnicodeDecodeError non intercettata.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"P3\",\n      \"severity\": \"blocking\",\n      \"file\": \"scripts/verify_external_services.py\",\n      \"line\": 376,\n      \"clause\": \"PRE-REVIEW-INPUT-ROBUSTNESS (2026-10-29) punti 1 e 2; NCP-U08-LANE-TEMPORAL-READINESS (2026-11-06) opzione B1\",\n      \"description\": \"Sul percorso del check tipizzato Temporal (check_temporal alle righe 374-378, che invoca _run_qualify_script alle righe 317-332 e _status_from_qualify_payload alle righe 335-343), né le eccezioni del sottoprocesso né la forma del JSON emesso da qualify.py sono tradotte o validate prima dell'uso: